Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re delivering the invaluable Energy Seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but the kids just can’t keep their guards up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that there’s a big, dangerous devil on the Big Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s very scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A big devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s working.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the big devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the “big devil” is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the only road
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that’ll take us to the Big Tree’s Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a massive spider web.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.66,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider web?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The big devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need any help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren’t you guys eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let it get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the Big Tree’s jumping spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Justice Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the personification of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Helping others is my favorite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you’re no “big devil”.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Tree World is still dangerous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve still got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I’ll protect you along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you’ve eaten, let’s get the ball rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I added too much pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll be safe with me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Justice Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t top me or my years of goat-catching experience, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This road is unsafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll find a different path for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that guy is really good at catching goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d make a great team, I’m sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like we always run into trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever Justice Spider “helps” us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop, didn’t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Justice Spider is, in fact, the supposed “big devil”.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t keep him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice Spider helped us in good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn’t go behind his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chatting in such a dark room will strain your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll turn on the lights. Where’s the switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that’s my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s my ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There, all nice and bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m… I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, I agree with your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I collected a list of insects
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go and give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they really need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re in the middle of dire crises
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and need you more than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll go right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s going to protect you guys if I’m gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll be just fine. You don’t need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Justice Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they didn’t give me any locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we’ve gotten rid of Justice Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t this a bit mean of us, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice Spider got us into all that trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s clumsy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve gotten hurt because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But… he…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have hated me all along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re sorry, we just meant that—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn’t have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go apologize to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I win over Justice Spider,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can catch all the goats in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind. All I do is cause harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been waiting for three days and nights!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you’re the personification of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The personification of justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of the wood scraps, no one will fall in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out first, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See? All I do is bring trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your just face,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and your set of just skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Most importantly, you have a heart of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,People always say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that one group of goats are always harassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d wholeheartedly helped them deliver things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did they not thank me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they dumped me in the pit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, my finger’s hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are their true colors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder they hated the just me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you help me capture those goats, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will! Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we couldn’t find Justice Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We must apologize to him face to face once we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You evil goats! Put your hands behind your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice Spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re sorry. We want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They love playing the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re all done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Onto the trains, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They blocked the road with acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The road is all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them elsewhere, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The goats have gotten away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I set up a giant web up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They have nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning: Threat detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the goats screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that Wolffy has convinced Justice Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure they can’t catch up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hear Wolffy and Justice Spider screaming just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be back!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
